[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9900.309, "timestamp": "02:45:00", "text": "昨天晚上。我一直熬到……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9900.722, "timestamp": "02:45:00", "author": "@rudratiwari8543", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kTnTV5MpIhweGe_pzwsKp471uZ-E1ks3cSA76oHUxgBQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🫂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9902.389, "timestamp": "02:45:02", "text": "8:00。然后我就想，“哦，我有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.309, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "合作。我睡吧。”然后我就睡着了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9907.19, "timestamp": "02:45:07", "text": "11点30分醒来。那真是太好了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9909.83, "timestamp": "02:45:09", "text": "很高兴我醒着。我醒来时30岁"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9911.99, "timestamp": "02:45:11", "text": "至少提前几分钟。否则我就会"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9916.494, "timestamp": "02:45:16", "author": "@rudratiwari8543", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kTnTV5MpIhweGe_pzwsKp471uZ-E1ks3cSA76oHUxgBQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "take care of yourself then sir ji"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9923.87, "timestamp": "02:45:23", "text": "是的，的确如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9925.87, "timestamp": "02:45:25", "text": "疯狂的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9929.11, "timestamp": "02:45:29", "text": "索菲亚，这就是我必须遵循的准则吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9931.349, "timestamp": "02:45:31", "text": "三个，就像我必须去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9936.469, "timestamp": "02:45:36", "text": "为这套西装裁缝。呃，测量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9939.79, "timestamp": "02:45:39", "text": "呃，看看我的西装是不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9942.389, "timestamp": "02:45:42", "text": "很好，因为我接下来要去日本了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9945.429, "timestamp": "02:45:45", "text": "月。哦，是的。呃，凯斯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9948.71, "timestamp": "02:45:48", "text": "呃，西装的正式着装要求是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9952.429, "timestamp": "02:45:52", "text": "东西？正式着装比如黑色西装，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9956.23, "timestamp": "02:45:56", "text": "正确的？所以目前为止我有两套西装，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9959.59, "timestamp": "02:45:59", "text": "据我表弟和叔叔们所知"}]